Just for your information: The OpenVMS V8.3 cannot be installed on a 
Multia. The last version successfully installed is V7.3-2. That needs 
to be done by booting and installing V7.3-1 first and then upgrading to 
V7.3-2 or then you have to make a modified master V7.3-2 installation-CD 
with the additional drivers needed for the Multia.

If you try to use V8.3 with the Multia drivers, you'll be in deep 
trouble. We tried it many ways, but it just doesn't work.

When you have installed V7.3-2 it will run fine.

Good Luck!

Kari




